  "label": "dishwasher is mapped as being at birth",
  "description": "The text 'rare picture of a dishwasher at birth' creates an analogical mapping where the visual entity 'dishwasher' is mapped onto the textual concept of 'at birth'. This mapping is based on the pun that equates the appliance's 'birth' (i.e., its first use or installation) with the biological concept of human birth, creating absurd humor. The dishwasher is the central visual entity being personified and infantilized by the text.",
